# A Command's two chosen modes each target something. Seat 0 (human) holds
# Kolaghan's Command and {1}{B}{R}; seat 1 (ai) has Grizzly Bears to take the
# 2 damage and two cards in hand to discard. With no creature card in seat 0's
# graveyard and no artifact anywhere, the two legal modes are "target player
# discards a card" and "2 damage to any target".
